ious applications. It sells its products through imaging system original equipment manufacturers, independent service companies, and distributors, as well as directly to end-users. The company has operations in North America, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, India, Africa, Asia, and Australia. The company was incorporated in 2016 and is headquartered in Salt Lake City, Utah."}}